"- `GLM-5.3-Flash-w8a8`: requires 1 Atlas 800 A3 (128GB × 8) node or 2 Atlas 800 A2 (64GB × 8) node.[Download model weight](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Eco-Tech/GLM-5.3-Flash-w8a8).\n"
